<title>JAPAN: Matsushita Refrig - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Matsushita Refrig - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 94.36		vs	   93.16</p>
<p> Operating	    2.02		vs	    1.49</p>
<p> Current		   3		vs	    2.82</p>
<p> Net		    2.95		vs	    2.76</p>
<p> EPS		   16.72 yen	  vs	   15.62 yen</p>
<p> Shares	    177 million	  vs	 177 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  5.00 yen	  vs	    5.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Matsushita Refrigeration Co is the refrigeration production arm of the Matsushita group.</p>
